  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In the Fedora Tech meeting from 2017-03-16 [1], it was decided to simplify the process for toggling between the three JMS configurations:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "publishing to a topic (default)",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "publishing to a queue",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "not publishing",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The suggestion out of that meeting was to:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. enable toggling between these options with a system property",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. improve the messaging configuration to limit resources when the queue option is selected",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The previous approach for repository configuration used to be to use system properties to select between pre-packaged configuration files. As of this ticket:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2393"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2393",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "..the recommendation has shifted to encouraging repository administrators to use a single configuration file that has been externalized from the deployed war.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "That said, I would suggest that this ticket therefore be refocused to:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. improve inline fcrepo-config.xml documentation to clarify the option to comment out either the topic or the queue sections.. or both if the administrator wants to disable messaging",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. (same) improve the messaging configuration to limit resources when the queue option is selected",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The assignee of this ticket should use their own judgement to determine if it makes sense to add more configuration in service of the #2 task above.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "There are three fcrepo-config.xml files that should be updated in the course of working this ticket:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-webapp/src/main/resources/spring/fcrepo-config.xml#L40-L57"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-webapp/src/main/resources/spring/fcrepo-config.xml#L40-L57",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "marks": [
            {
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-webapp-plus/blob/master/src/main/webapp/WEB-INF/classes/spring/fcrepo-config.xml#L168-L185"
             },
             "type": "link"
            }
           ],
           "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-webapp-plus/blob/master/src/main/webapp/WEB-INF/classes/spring/fcrepo-config.xml#L168-L185",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
